sequenceDiagram
    participant Brand as LVMH Brand
    participant SC as LuxuryProductCertificate<br/>(ERC-721 on Besu)
    participant Owner as First Owner
    participant Buyer as Secondary Buyer

    Note over Brand,SC: ISSUANCE — Brand mints certificate
    Brand->>SC: issueCertificate(<br/>tokenId, firstOwner,<br/>brand, model, serial,<br/>materialOrigin, ipfsHash)
    SC->>SC: Require: caller has BRAND_ROLE
    SC->>SC: Store ProductCertificate struct
    SC->>SC: _mint(firstOwner, tokenId)
    SC->>SC: Push firstOwner to ownershipHistory[]
    SC-->>Brand: Emit CertificateIssued event

    Note over Owner,Buyer: TRANSFER — Ownership change
    Owner->>SC: transferFrom(owner, buyer, tokenId)
    SC->>SC: Verify: caller is owner or approved
    SC->>SC: ERC-721 transfer
    SC->>SC: Push buyer to ownershipHistory[]
    SC-->>Owner: Emit OwnershipTransferred event

    Note over Buyer,SC: VERIFICATION — Prove authenticity
    Buyer->>SC: verifyCertificate(tokenId)
    SC-->>Buyer: Return ProductCertificate struct<br/>(brand, model, serial, origin, ipfsHash)
    Buyer->>SC: getOwnershipHistory(tokenId)
    SC-->>Buyer: Return address[] full chain
